<!-- wp:wd/title {"blockId":"915c8038-77b5-4d7f-ab2c-8324228aa879","blockVersion":"2","content":"Frequently asked questions","tpFontSize":"40","tpLineHeight":"1.2","tpFontSizeTablet":"32","tpFontSizeMobile":"24","tpLineHeightUnits":"em"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-wd-title title wd-915c8038">Frequently asked questions</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion {"blockId":"e45bbe26-267f-4ac0-8e01-6281302e17e8","blockVersion":"2","design":"shadow","allClosed":true,"titleTpFontSize":"20","titleTpFontVariant":"600","titleTpFontWeight":"600","titlesColorCode":"#333333","titlesHoverColorCode":"#242424","marginBottom":"40","titleTpFontSizeTablet":"18","titleTpFontSizeMobile":"16","marginBottomTablet":"20","marginBottomMobile":"0"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion wd-accordion wd-style-shadow wd-titles-start wd-opener-style-arrow wd-opener-pos-end wd-e45bbe26" data-state="all"><!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"9e2f2e54-6333-44e2-a241-44d74153b870","blockVersion":"2","bgColorCode":"#ffffff","boxShadowColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","boxShadowBlur":0} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-9e2f2e54"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>What are the benefits of using a mechanical keyboard over a membrane keyboard?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"c4334ba2-fb96-4006-aad7-f552474d3fb5","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-c4334ba2">A seemingly elegant design can quickly begin to bloat with unexpected content or break under the weight of actual activity. Fake data can ensure a nice looking layout but it doesn’t reflect what a living, breathing application must endure. Real data does.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"188a79e4-de07-4291-9329-46c98dfca8a4","blockVersion":"2","bgColorCode":"#ffffff","boxShadowColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","boxShadowBlur":0} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-188a79e4"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>How do I choose the right switch for my mechanical keyboard?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"94aa5446-f870-46db-a952-1319cdc3dda1","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-94aa5446">Websites in professional use templating systems. Commercial publishing platforms and content management systems ensure that you can show different text, different data using the same template. When it’s about controlling hundreds of articles, product pages for web shops.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"940a05a7-e217-485f-98f9-b607d01a00f3","blockVersion":"2","bgColorCode":"#ffffff","boxShadowColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","boxShadowBlur":0} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-940a05a7"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>Can I customize my mechanical keyboard?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"54283943-da97-48eb-8fa9-cc85adc35417","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-54283943">If the contents of the parcel are suspicious to customs officers (for example, many identical goods), it may be further checked. Keep the product in its original packaging along with all documents confirming the purchase and refund. You will need this for further communication with the seller and the payment system.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"fd364984-0da0-4124-aaa6-65479d459af6","blockVersion":"2","bgColorCode":"#ffffff","boxShadowColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","boxShadowBlur":0} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-fd364984"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>What is the difference between RGB and non-RGB mechanical keyboards?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"766d3275-73f2-46c3-aa4b-4d75e4632afd","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-766d3275">Check the email you received after placing your order. It should contain information about the status of your order and the expected delivery date. Keep the product in its original packaging along with all documents confirming the purchase and refund. You will need this for further communication with the seller and the payment system.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"f19283c9-fff1-4f11-a386-1a81b649a170","blockVersion":"2","bgColorCode":"#ffffff","boxShadowColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","boxShadowBlur":0} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-f19283c9"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>How do I clean and maintain my mechanical keyboard?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"e241c342-5bb0-459e-b451-6e39a4b4e8ba","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-e241c342">Websites in professional use templating systems. Commercial publishing platforms and content management systems ensure that you can show different text, different data using the same template. When it’s about controlling hundreds of articles, product pages for web shops.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion -->]]></content:encoded>
